ile-nav\" aria-label=\"Open menu\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu size-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg></button></div></nav></header><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col\"><main class=\"container-page flex flex-col gap-7 px-4 py-8 sm:px-6\"><header class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Renter</p><h1 class=\"display\">Dashboard</h1><p class=\"page-lede max-w-2xl\">Every decision you receive references its on-chain entry index, so you can confirm that what you paid for came from the agent you rented.</p></header><div class=\"border-border flex flex-col items-center gap-3 rounded-lg border border-dashed px-6 py-14 text-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-wallet text-muted-foreground size-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M19 7V4a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H5a2 2 0 0 0 0 4h15a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v4h-3a2 2 0 0 0 0 4h3a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-2a1 1 0 0 0-1-1\"></path><path d=\"M3 5v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h15a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-4\"></path></svg><p class=\"font-medium\">Connect a wallet to see your rentals</p><p class=\"text-muted-foreground max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed\">Your dashboard lists the agents you have rented and streams their verified decisions. Reading records and verifying transactions never require a wallet.</p><button data-slot=\"button\" data-variant=\"default\" data-size=\"sm\" class=\"group/button inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-transparent bg-clip-padding font-medium whitespace-nowrap transition-all outline-none select-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-3 focus-visible:ring-ring/50 active:not-aria-[haspopup]:translate-y-px disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 aria-invalid:border-destructive aria-invalid:ring-3 aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:border-destructive/50 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/85 h-8 gap-1.5 px-3.5 text-[0.8rem] has-data-[icon=inline-end]:pr-2.5 has-data-[icon=inline-start]:pl-2.5 [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-3.5\">Connect wallet</button></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--></div><footer class=\"border-border mt-auto border-t\"><div class=\"container-page flex flex-col gap-6 px-4 py-10 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-6 md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-between\"><p class=\"text-muted-foreground max-w-xl text-sm leading-relaxed\">Strategy sealed on 0G Storage, never on the public chain<!-- -->; <!-- -->decisions attested by 0G TeeML<!-- -->; <!-- -->request commitment sealed, auditable under authorized access<!-- -->.</p><nav class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-1 gap-y-2 md:justify-end\" aria-label=\"Footer\"><a href=\"https://github.com/winsznx/fief\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground hover:bg-muted focus-visible:ring-ring/60 rounded-lg px-3 py-1.5 text-sm transition-colors focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:outline-none\">GitHub</a><a href=\"https://docs.0g.ai\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground hover:bg-muted focus-visible:ring-ring/60 rounded-lg px-3 py-1.5 text-sm transition-colors focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:outline-none\">0G docs</a><a class=\"text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground hover:bg-muted focus-visible:ring-ring/60 rounded-lg px-3 py-1.5 text-sm transition-colors focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:outline-none\" href=\"/verify\">Verify a transaction</a><a class=\"text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground hover:bg-muted focus-visible:ring-ring/60 rounded-lg px-3 py-1.5 text-sm transition-colors focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:outline-none\" href=\"/about\">Honest limits</a></nav></div><div class=\"border-border flex flex-col gap-3 border-t pt-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between\"><p class=\"text-muted-foreground text-xs\">Provenance only. No custody, no execution, no verification of profit or loss.</p><code class=\"text-muted-foreground border-border shrink-0 rounded-sm border px-3 py-1 font-mono text-xs\">pnpm fief-verify --tx &lt;hash&gt;</code></div></div></footer><section aria-label=\"Notifications alt+T\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-relevant=\"additions text\" aria-atomic=\"false\" data-react-aria-top-layer=\"true\"></section><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0i7-u46n5dwv1.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[96923,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/04ry7a0oq1nxi.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3c9jkoppk_ssg.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3gfc9935i2hyt.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0mvms5l01zt68.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0azshvrjoj5yx.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1czhll-4u2610.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/40g7prjkx48wy.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1m_adzyzc3xyr.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/22jwxos-9dwi7.js\\\"],\\\"Providers\\\"]\\n3:I[13703,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/04ry7a0oq1nxi.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3c9jkoppk_ssg.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3gfc9935i2hyt.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0mvms5l01zt68.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0azshvrjoj5yx.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1czhll-4u2610.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/40g7prjkx48wy.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1m_adzyzc3xyr.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/22jwxos-9dwi7.js\\\"],\\\"TopNav\\\"]\\n4:I[82151,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/04ry7a0oq1nxi.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3c9jkoppk_ssg.js\\\",\\\"/_n